.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1348920/extras/f4410bc5d858ccd8146085b3a4f3a214.webp?t=1744303835\" width=14 height=13 /></span> Cute casual gameplay<br><br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1348920/extras/0c36eb03106e554a9042301129fd9035.webp?t=1744303835\" width=280 height=35 /></span><br>In Wind Peaks the story is told through the hidden objects and by the level set pieces. To progress with it, find every object to revel a cutscene.<br><br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1348920/extras/5c2d313a227c43c01bc2bc729c6d4a38.webp?t=1744303835\" width=280 height=35 /></span><br>~ 1.5 hours<br><br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1348920/extras/f4410bc5d858ccd8146085b3a4f3a214.webp?t=1744303835\" width=14 height=13 /></span> No death / violence<br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1348920/extras/f4410bc5d858ccd8146085b3a4f3a214.webp?t=1744303835\" width=14 height=13 /></span> No hyper-realism / last-gen graphics<br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1348920/extras/f4410bc5d858ccd8146085b3a4f3a214.webp?t=1744303835\" width=14 height=13 /></span> No procedural worlds<br><br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline crossorigin=\"anonymous\" poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1348920/extras/10adb0ec0cd659986f20028c2f08229d.poster.avif?t=1744303835\" width=480 height=340 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1348920/extras/10adb0ec0cd659986f20028c2f08229d.webm?t=1744303835\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"></video></